~ start
if first_interaction:
	=> first_interaction
else:
	=> regular

~ first_interaction
do set_avatar("appa")
Appa: Are you enjoying your day?
do set_avatar("sree")
You: Yes! Very much!
do set_avatar("appa")
Appa: Very well, I will take you to get some black current icecream in the evening.
Appa: Don't tell your Omma this.
do set_avatar("sree")
You: Yay! okay I won't tell her.
do set_avatar("appa")
Appa: Now go enjoy your day.

set first_interaction = false
do EventManager.finish_task(EventManager.task_ids.talk_to_appa)
=> END

~ regular
do set_avatar("appa")
Appa: Be ready by evening, if you want icecream.

=> END